971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"试验组与对照组：合成试验药C辅助组；安慰剂辅助组","quote_sha256":"a70592efac4f1e3f2e4ebb157d0fec950336d619a06c86769179e507f59843e1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"sp_arms"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:revision:3","quote":"访视策略：筛选、基线及第1、2、4、6、8周访视，第10周安全性随访；MADRS由经培训且尽量保持同一的盲态评估者完成。","quote_sha256":"a5f71518e97723c4337a87f2fdb48f3243d0e56402965a4994070ccbe8182973","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","span_id":"sp_visit"},{"locator":"section:6.3.3 揭盲|block:490|chunk:1","quote":"紧急揭盲借助IWRS中“揭盲参与者”进行。","quote_sha256":"4a60d556bf65415879e4a4fde02f18bf5d37a65407ddb3a9b0558f4ef48fc5e3","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","span_id":"sp_corpus_unblind_iwrs"},{"locator":"section:研究揭盲|block:464|chunk:1","quote":"本研究的Part-1 SAD研究、Part-2 MAD研究将分别在其最后一例参与者研究结束后进行揭盲。","quote_sha256":"122858ef2facbd2cc7dd6109a526581d6befed9cbedff6c036efa392c62e2499","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","span_id":"sp_corpus_unblind_timing"},{"locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:356|chunk:1","quote":"紧急揭盲之后该试验参与者将退出本研究。","quote_sha256":"899916d0c904d6b9d0e9634f01e2a6ac6e26dd28329f1b91242afe01f7f23204","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","span_id":"sp_corpus_unblind_proc"}],"evidence_span_ids":["sp_sec_blind","sp_blindroles","sp_blindimpl","sp_rand","sp_interv","sp_arms","sp_visit","sp_corpus_unblind_iwrs","sp_corpus_unblind_timing","sp_corpus_unblind_proc"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":3,"project_fact_spans":6},"gap_items":[{"action":"调取本项目揭盲程序与随机化/揭盲系统操作说明，由医学经理与研究团队确认后补入本章节","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_4_4_unblinding_procedure","missing_source_classes":["项目揭盲程序/紧急揭盲操作文件","随机化与揭盲系统操作说明"],"target":"4.4 盲法与揭盲章节中的揭盲程序部分（紧急揭盲条件、操作步骤与记录要求）"},{"action":"依据本项目盲态维持与破盲管理文件确认后补充相应正文","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_4_4_blinding_maintenance","missing_source_classes":["盲态维持与破盲管理项目文件"],"target":"4.4 盲态维持与破盲管理部分（各角色盲态范围、揭盲后处理与揭盲记录）"}],"heading":"盲法与揭盲","missing_source_classes":["项目揭盲程序/紧急揭盲操作文件","随机化与揭盲系统操作说明","盲态维持与破盲管理项目文件"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用双盲设计，试验组与对照组按1:1随机分配，试验参与者、研究者及结局评估者均对治疗分配保持盲态。试验组口服合成试验药C，对照组口服与之一致的匹配安慰剂，通过匹配安慰剂维持盲态，盲态在8周双盲辅助治疗期内维持。疗效评估采用MADRS量表，由经培训且尽量保持同一的盲态评估者完成。","rationale":"双盲设计、1:1随机、试验参与者/研究者/结局评估者盲态角色、匹配安慰剂维持盲态、8周双盲辅助治疗期以及MADRS由经培训且尽量保持同一的盲态评估者完成均来自本项目已确认研究事实；揭盲程序、紧急揭盲操作与揭盲时点在本批来源中没有项目依据，未写入正文。其他产品方案中的揭盲条文仅可作为章节结构参照。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（盲法与揭盲）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_61c5aef9d5f1637e","section_number":"4.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2345d68fb2059dd6d3ca47d8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b2e912d7b623:r3:8c781ae0091a9043","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"03762a1d7ffbc7ca0f089c29baebe624699caab2aabf438bf44ba5a5a9ce97bb","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_0cec66a7da6e_92dc32ead2551dda:full-draft:2345d68fb2059dd6d3ca47d8","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:2345d68fb2059dd6d3ca47d8","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:c315238e8975745fc5500ae52859c14372253487b00aa4718f4224a279fcb0b5:2345d68fb2059dd6d3ca47d8","text_sha256":"03762a1d7ffbc7ca0f089c29baebe624699caab2aabf438bf44ba5a5a9ce97bb"},{"content_sha256":"844b3acb36f874917fb1ab2400816e3caff7f00a41b34d1a674f95d57696b803","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_f76f9971b